# FD-37: the repository builds and tests on macOS, Windows and Linux. Text is LF everywhere — a
# CRLF checkout on Windows broke text checks (release.yml) and would break the Linux sh launcher —
# except Windows command scripts, which cmd.exe reads as CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.dmg binary
*.zip binary
